    "design_decisions": "Used `lines.firstIndex(where: { $0.trimmingCharacters(in: .whitespaces) == \"## Meals\" })` for section detection (exact match after trim, case-sensitive) to avoid false positives on headings like `## Meals Prep`. Used \"last non-blank line + 1\" as insertion point inside an existing section so bullets cluster together above any trailing blank line that separates the section from the next `##` heading. Trailing blank injected on creation only when next line is already a `## ` heading, per spec wording.",
